{"time": 1766672185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347035104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“泰瑞先生是吗”"}
{"time": 1766672189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892015520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“各位早上好。看样子你们三位应该就是接受委托的人了”"}
{"time": 1766672204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455866721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“这次调查很简单”"}
{"time": 1766672231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910172429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“我是这边黑背街 13 号的房东，有一个租客，名字叫沃姆布莱克，是水泥厂的工人，住在 13 号四楼，今天早上我想找他收租，结果一开门却没有找到人影，打他电话他也不接。我开始以为他是想逃房租了，后来去调监控才发现，他自从两周前回到家后就再也没有离开过。”他头疼地揉了揉眉头，“这边希望你能帮我找到他，至少帮我找回房租，委托费用的话好说”"}
{"time": 1766672291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182483029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“再没有离开过？”"}
{"time": 1766672299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417814767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“黑背街13号吗？我知道了”"}
{"time": 1766672306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956451950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“只要没有发生什么流血事件，我没有什么要求”"}
{"time": 1766672321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676812741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "*点点头“至少从监控上看是这样”"}
{"time": 1766672333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33554787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”密室失踪……他能去哪儿？“"}
{"time": 1766672368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203966331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“哦对了，这次调查还请尽量不要报警”"}
{"time": 1766672371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1384666982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“这可奇怪了，您的出租屋有地下室之类的吗”"}
{"time": 1766672376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162869258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”唉，不知道您有没有警局的关系，超过2000元可以立案侦查一下“"}
{"time": 1766672385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1104387721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=203966331]”为什么？“"}
{"time": 1766672392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221245066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“以及，有没有什么值得注意的？比如说味道”"}
{"time": 1766672425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175620681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=221245066]”这些到现场我们自己看吧，二手证据总是模糊的“"}
{"time": 1766672429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587131668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（指赶进度）"}
{"time": 1766672431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221191214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“毕竟也算是我认识的人。。。您没有亲自或者派人检查过房屋吗？”"}
{"time": 1766672443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519722296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“你们的报酬和他所付的租金挂钩，你们找到他帮我要到租金了就是全额酬劳，要是报警”*他耸耸肩“那就只有基础的出勤费了”"}
{"time": 1766672474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1585898796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”嗯，好吧。“"}
{"time": 1766672505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715366538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#虽然菲莉汐娅家里不差钱，不过委托能多赚点也是好事"}
{"time": 1766672519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109750491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“不报警的原因很简单。如你们所见，我是房东。假如我的租户知道这里发生了失踪案会怎么想？那些在观望在犹豫的潜在租户又会怎么想？”"}
{"time": 1766672523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779669943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“虽然我不知道这期间有什么关联，不过考虑到这个州警方的做派。。。我对您的提议持赞成态度。”"}
{"time": 1766672539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899960205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1175620681]“小妹妹真是心急，那好吧，快点动身吧”"}
{"time": 1766672550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "525801563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“所以不到万不得已，你们实在处理不了了，还请不要报警”"}
{"time": 1766672561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294669102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”那么，有房间的钥匙吗？我们打算先去房间看看“"}
{"time": 1766672566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137818885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=525801563]“当然”"}
{"time": 1766672579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753381700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“很好，看样子我们彼此都达成合作了”"}
{"time": 1766672614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109393896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "*掏出一份钥匙递过去“这是他的钥匙，这次委托就全权交给你们了”"}
{"time": 1766672637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070882271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“我在别的地方还有房产要打理呢，不能在这浪费这么长时间”"}
{"time": 1766672664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616945197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“亲自委托辛苦您了”"}
{"time": 1766672670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378200370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”好的，那么就这样吧，有事联系您。“"}
{"time": 1766672675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916154190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（言外之意就是你没有管家吗（））"}
