{"time": 1766674539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887544384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "卧室同样不大，一张单人床，几个柜子便是全部，单人床上面的床单微微泛\n黄，像是很久没有洗了，上面还有烟灰烫出的小洞。卧室和客厅的窗户上面一\n样，都安装着厚重的防盗窗，搞得卧室好像监狱一般。"}
{"time": 1766674549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669602262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1554329534]“好的，小心卫生安全”"}
{"time": 1766674575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855873349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "你在另一个柜子里发现84消毒液"}
{"time": 1766674593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310802705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯”"}
{"time": 1766674593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026008892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "先试着直接拨开鼠群吧，有可能导致它们四散开来吗？"}
{"time": 1766674601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194016189", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "*翻开柜子看看"}
{"time": 1766674618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842678955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（窗户开着吗）"}
{"time": 1766674623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333995320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（窗帘）"}
{"time": 1766674670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876453804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "这些老鼠尾巴打结成了一团，感觉不会轻易散开。事实上，老鼠们已经尝试挣脱很久了，下面的鼠尸中就有大量的断尾鼠"}
{"time": 1766674683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649512566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（有点难绷）"}
{"time": 1766674687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443006699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（杀虫公司来了）"}
{"time": 1766674695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451638852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "看样子是失去尾巴受到刺激失血而亡"}
{"time": 1766674715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959805738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（杀虫公司来了）"}
{"time": 1766674731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555756761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1842678955][CQ:at,qq=408119794] 窗户开着，但是窗帘遮住了"}
{"time": 1766674787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736961070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#趁着妮可干老鼠，先去卫生间看看"}
{"time": 1766674791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121337394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“即便断开了尾巴也没有或者逃出橱柜啊。。。唉，你们的苦痛将要结束了。”"}
{"time": 1766674806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831108763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={BCCCE4DE-5026-55B3-3B74-EC21BBB682EA}.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-BCCCE4DE502655B33B74EC21BBB682EA/0,file_size=8416]"}
{"time": 1766674808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570723184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "*先拉开窗帘，看看窗外的景色，以及窗台的陈迹"}
{"time": 1766674815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820843517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "至于卫生间，尽管同样很脏，不过洗手间相较于房间的其他地方还是相对干\n净一点的。洗手间内十分狭窄，就好像已经监狱，旁边有一扇小小的窗户，一\n点残余的光从窗外照了进来，也给这间狭窄的卫生间带来一点温馨，让你知道\n这不是监狱，而是一间普通的卫生间。"}
{"time": 1766674829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242908511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（[CQ:image,file=54051F0E2D87D89A28745F842FB7A95E.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTSfQbAs_nF9HY4Q9RrBKoD7Tu_YRjK8wYg_woot8jYzIDZkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQZqPQPB10eHZDYLXkMyc28XoCBYGCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMMHmHtSBC2RqRNPO0VDnBDIvY8Kp6UaGUKUvu4LEudifoolqlPco7MPkKqxXdNX1bQ,file_size=113098]这啥）"}
{"time": 1766674847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767523547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=820843517]#窗户也有防盗窗吗"}
{"time": 1766674863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2111081198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=570723184][CQ:at,qq=408119794] 窗外就是你们刚刚见到的景色。窗台上面已经有一层灰了，看样子有一段时间了"}
{"time": 1766674867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "401299073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "妮可打开所有能通风的系统，然后将84和洁厕灵混合在烟灰缸里以后放进了橱柜里，接着用扫帚横过来卡住了橱柜门"}
{"time": 1766674873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196719628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1242908511][CQ:at,qq=408119794] （衣柜"}
{"time": 1766674891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015056664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "在此毒气室工作期间检查一下厨房的其他部分和容器，申请侦查"}
{"time": 1766674922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792964207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“至少有点光了....”*转头依次调查一下床头柜、床单和枕头、床底、衣柜里的东西"}
{"time": 1766674964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358746218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "妮可在放入毒气源之前，在两肩和额头上分别点了一下。"}
{"time": 1766674975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951336201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=401299073]你听见橱柜里传来前所未有的剧烈惨叫，有如撕心裂肺的哭号。老鼠们在柜子里疯狂撞击，逃窜，撕咬，血腥味前所未有的浓烈"}
{"time": 1766675010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337673479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“....什么声音、什么味道”"}
