{"time": 1766675029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42219740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "。ra侦查"}
{"time": 1766675029, "type": "reply", "message_id": "42219740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[妮可]进行技能[侦查:77]检定: 1D100=10 极难成功，流水落花春去也，天上人间"}
{"time": 1766675041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837675349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "。。。"}
{"time": 1766675046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414251522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1792964207][CQ:at,qq=408119794]  \n卧室柜子里面是一个破破烂烂的金属工牌，上面写着沃姆布莱克，洛克水泥\n厂。旁边放着一张体检报告，说明体检人布莱克各方面正常，但是酗酒过度，\n伤肝，报告结尾的署名是克里斯·多内甘。这份体检报告是本市最大的医院怀\n特医院开出来的。"}
{"time": 1766675057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306797582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "床底下发现万宝路香烟的烟蒂。"}
{"time": 1766675093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1253189079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1414251522]*看看日期"}
{"time": 1766675103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028996840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2094527673][CQ:at,qq=2875548981]  你注意到到处都是的烟蒂其实是两种不同的香\n烟，一种是便宜的万宝路，那一种是稍稍上一点档次的黄金叶。"}
{"time": 1766675116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255793478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "老鼠的哀吱让妮可提起了精神来，她确信自己没有遗漏厨房的绝大部分细节"}
{"time": 1766675138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "89633292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1253189079][CQ:at,qq=408119794] 大概在半年前"}
