{"time": 1766675332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794038243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=131699350][CQ:at,qq=408119794] 你在衣柜里发现了水泥厂的工服，上面也写有布莱克的标签。这件衣服看上去脏兮兮的，像是很长时间没洗了"}
{"time": 1766675360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274757502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2094527673]（）"}
{"time": 1766675361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133117604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "卫生间里有着淡淡的沐浴露的清香。相较于其\n他的房间，这里的灰尘显然没有那么厚，像是\n有清洗过的痕迹。而且淋浴花洒上面隐约有磨\n损的痕迹，像是曾经有什么东西吊在上面。"}
{"time": 1766675375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805931775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（到我了艾特我）"}
