{"time": 1766676564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471033591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#的确，我不是他，所以我回去上课，而他，会去喝酒"}
{"time": 1766676591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1690232922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“最后我将那些被捆在一起的家伙人道毁灭了——”叹气"}
